{
  "$format": "janus-conformance-case/1",
  "id": "facade/pact-jvm-extension",
  "category": "facade",
  "facade": "pact-jvm",
  "title": "pact-jvm's JUnit 5 extension serves each test's pact once, from a @Pact method returning a RequestResponsePact or a V4Pact, and injects it.",
  "covers": [],
  "rows": [
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`@ExtendWith(PactConsumerTestExt.class)`, `@PactConsumerTest`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`@Pact(consumer, provider)` on a method taking `PactDslWithProvider` or `MessagePactBuilder`, returning `RequestResponsePact`, `MessagePact` or `V4Pact`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`@PactTestFor(providerName, pactMethod, pactMethods, pactVersion, providerType)`, on the class or the method"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "The injected `RequestResponsePact` or `V4Pact`"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "The test runs once, against each interaction's example"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "`given(state)`, `given(state, params)`, several states"
    },
    {
      "note": "Documentation/consumer-test-migration.md",
      "row": "Several interactions in one pact, chained by `given` or `uponReceiving` after `willRespondWith`"
    }
  ],
  "why": "consumer-test-migration.md, pact-jvm: the extension, `@Pact` methods and `@PactTestFor` on the class or the method are the same; the injected pact is the same; the test runs once, against each interaction's example; `given` with and without parameters, and several states, are the same; several interactions chain in one pact.",
  "subjects": { "jvm": "PactJvmExtension.java" },
  "expect": {
    "tests": [{ "test": "getsOrders" }, { "test": "cancelsAnOrder" }],
    "contracts": {
      "web-app-orders-api.janus.json": {
        "content": {
          "interactions": [
            {
              "description": "cancel an order",
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "method": { "example": "DELETE", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders/1", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": { "status": { "example": 204, "shape": "equality" } }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "get an order",
              "states": [{ "name": "an order exists", "params": { "id": 1 } }, { "name": "the customer is known" }],
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "method": { "example": "GET", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders/1", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": { "members": { "id": { "example": 1, "shape": "equality" } }, "shape": "object" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 200, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "description": "list no orders",
              "states": [{ "name": "no orders exist" }],
              "parts": {
                "request": {
                  "method": { "example": "GET", "shape": "equality" },
                  "path": { "example": "/orders", "shape": "equality" }
                },
                "response": {
                  "body": { "entries": [], "shape": "array" },
                  "headers": {
                    "members": {
                      "content-type": {
                        "entries": [
                          {
                            "shape": "http:media-type",
                            "type": "application/json",
                            "example": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "shape": "array"
                      }
                    },
                    "shape": "object"
                  },
                  "status": { "example": 200, "shape": "equality" }
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
